{
  "_why": "These tiles bake their spec strip into pixels, so no test can read it. Each entry records the figures composited onto the artwork together with digests of the exact files they were composited into. If counts.json moves, the figure check fails and the tile must be re-rendered; if either file changes, its digest check fails until the strip is re-read and re-pinned. All forty-seven tiles now pin a motion file as well as a poster: the poster is only frame zero, and correcting it alone once left four animations still rendering a figure ten thousand short. Eight engines carry no Controls figure in their spec_strip, so their strip omits that cell rather than inventing one, and their pin carries no controls key.",
